WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.505
All of it inside Mercury's orbit.

00:03.205 --> 00:08.770
The dashed ring is the size of Mercury's orbit round our Sun, drawn here for scale.

00:09.220 --> 00:17.406
It is six times wider than the orbit of h: every one of these worlds is closer to its star than Mercury is to ours.
